---
name: sprint-plan
version: 1.1.0
description: Generate a sprint plan document for atm-core phases.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - id
  - title
  - branch
  - target
optional_variables:
  - status
  - worktree
  - recommended_agent
  - recommended_model
  - execution_mode
  - execution_dependencies
  - dependencies_relation
  - goal
  - dependencies
  - exact_targets
  - deliverables
  - required_work
  - explicit_code_samples
  - non_closure
  - acceptance_criteria
  - validation
defaults:
  status: planned
  worktree: ""
  recommended_agent: ""
  recommended_model: ""
  execution_mode: parallel
  execution_dependencies: []
  dependencies_relation: []
  goal: []
  dependencies: []
  exact_targets: []
  deliverables: []
  required_work: []
  explicit_code_samples: []
  non_closure: []
  acceptance_criteria: []
  validation:
    - "cargo build --workspace"
    - "cargo test --workspace"
    - "cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings"
    - "git diff --check"
---
---
id: {{ id }}
title: {{ title }}
status: {{ status }}
branch: {{ branch }}
{% if worktree %}worktree: {{ worktree }}
{% endif %}{% if recommended_agent %}recommended_agent: {{ recommended_agent }}
{% endif %}{% if recommended_model %}recommended_model: {{ recommended_model }}
{% endif %}execution_mode: {{ execution_mode }}
{% if execution_dependencies %}execution_dependencies:
{% for dep in execution_dependencies %}  - {{ dep }}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
target: {{ target }}
---

# Sprint {{ id }} — {{ title }}

{% if recommended_agent or recommended_model %}## Recommended Agent / Model

{% if recommended_agent %}Recommended agent: {{ recommended_agent }}.
{% endif %}{% if recommended_model %}Recommended model: {{ recommended_model }}.
{% endif %}This is a planning-time recommendation, not a binding assignment;
team-lead makes the final dispatch decision based on current availability.

{% endif %}## Goal

{% for item in goal %}- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
## Execution Dependencies

{% if execution_dependencies %}This sprint must not begin until every
listed dependency has merged into `{{ target }}`. Before coding, merge-forward
the updated target into this sprint branch and verify each dependency is an
ancestor of the branch head. This sprint may not be qualified or merged into
`{{ target }}` before every listed dependency is merged there.

{% for dep in execution_dependencies %}- {{ dep }}
{% endfor %}{% else %}This sprint may execute in parallel from its declared
target. It has no required prior-sprint merge-forward; use this mode only when
its ownership does not intersect a concurrent sprint's modules, crates, public
contract, generated artifact, or ownership seam.
{% endif %}

## Dependency Relations

{% if dependencies_relation %}{% for relation in dependencies_relation %}- {{ relation.sprint }} ({{ relation.relation }} — {{ relation.rationale }})
{% endfor %}{% else %}{% for dep in dependencies %}- {{ dep }} (must follow; relation rationale not supplied)
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
## Exact Targets

{% for file in exact_targets %}- `{{ file }}`
{% endfor %}
## Deliverables

Every listed deliverable is expected to land at a production-ready level for
the scope this sprint claims. If that cannot be done cleanly in one sprint, the
sprint must be split before implementation begins. No deliverable may be
silently dropped or partially deferred.

{% for item in deliverables %}- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
## Required Work

{% for item in required_work %}- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
## Explicit Code Samples

If the sprint introduces or changes important traits, features, enums, protocol
types, boundary contracts, or execution seams, this section must include
explicit code samples or signatures showing the intended end state.

{% for item in explicit_code_samples %}{{ item }}
{% endfor %}
## This Sprint Does Not Close

{% for item in non_closure %}- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
## Acceptance Criteria

{% for criterion in acceptance_criteria %}- {{ criterion }}
{% endfor %}
## Required Validation

{% for cmd in validation %}- `{{ cmd }}`
{% endfor %}
